Package: amd-hsmp-dkms
Architecture: amd64
Depends: dkms (>= 2.1.0.0), gcc | c-compiler, kmod, make
Recommends: linux-headers-amd64 | linux-headers-generic
Description: DKMS source for the AMD HSMP kernel module
 The Host System Management Port (HSMP) kernel module provides user space
 access to the HSMP mailboxes implemented by AMD platform firmware.
 .
 This package installs the AMD HSMP module source for DKMS. DKMS builds and
 installs the modules for installed kernels during package configuration and
 when kernel headers are upgraded.
